sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant S as Safety
  participant E as Emotion
  participant R as Reflection
  participant D as Database
  U->>F: Submit journal
  F->>A: POST analysis request
  A->>D: Store journal and queued analysis
  A->>S: Screen for safety
  S-->>A: Risk result
  A->>E: Analyze emotion
  E-->>A: Emotion result
  A->>R: Generate reflection
  R-->>A: Reflection result
  A->>D: Persist analysis and reflection
  A-->>F: Return analysis status/result
